# Text formatting: Markup markdown for bold, italic, underline, strikethrough and links within a line, and Markup none.
Document (dev.stxt.pdf):
	Language: en
	Title: Text formatting · Markup
	Page:
		Paper: A4
		Margin: 20mm
	Styles:
		For style: source
			Typography:
				Font: IBM Plex Mono
				Size: 9
				Color: muted
		For style: result
			Box:
				Margin: 0 0 12 0
			Typography:
				Size: 12
				Line height: 17
				Markup: markdown
		For style: link
			Typography:
				Color: accent
	Section:
		Text: Text formatting
			Style: topic
		Heading 1:
			Text: Markup
		Paragraph: By default a text is literal. With `Markup: markdown`, a `Text`, a `Paragraph` or a `Cell` reads the Markdown marks within the line. Each pair below shows what is written (in gray) and what is painted.
			Style: intro
		Text: Payment is due in **30 days**, unless *otherwise agreed*.
			Style: source
		Text: Payment is due in **30 days**, unless *otherwise agreed*.
			Style: result
		Text: ***Bold and italic***, ++underline++ and ~~strikethrough~~.
			Style: source
		Text: ***Bold and italic***, ++underline++ and ~~strikethrough~~.
			Style: result
		Text: A [link to the website](https://stxt.dev), underlined and clickable.
			Style: source
		Text: A [link to the website](https://stxt.dev), underlined and clickable.
			Style: result
		Text: A literal \*asterisk\* and [brackets] that are not a link: 2024. A good year - 5% off
			Style: source
		Text: A literal \*asterisk\* and [brackets] that are not a link: 2024. A good year - 5% off
			Style: result
		Text: Markup: none  (the default: the marks are painted as they are written)
			Style: label
			Box:
				Margin: 12 0 4 0
		Text: Payment is due in **30 days**, unless *otherwise agreed*.
			Style: result
			Typography:
				Markup: none
		Text: Bold within a bold text, and within a light one (Weight: 300)
			Style: label
			Box:
				Margin: 12 0 4 0
		Text: A bold title with **bold** words stays bold.
			Style: result
			Typography:
				Bold: true
		Text: A light text with **bold** words gets weight 700 in them.
			Style: result
			Typography:
				Weight: 300
